@@ -0,0 +1,3 @@
+# Cloudflare Agents runtime
+
+Deployment owners must declare the registered agent classes as Cloudflare Durable Object bindings, add each class to a SQLite Durable Object migration, configure the provider binding used for model access, and deploy the Worker entrypoint and routes. Repository source does not establish that deployment configuration; verify it in the Worker configuration and deployed environment.
